msgstr "  Níos lú ná dhá cheamara le fuaim -- róbheagán do Multitrack."

msgid "  Finished mixdown requested as the yardstick (%s)"
msgstr "  Iarradh an mixdown críochnaithe mar shlat tomhais (%s)"

msgid "does not start where the block before it ends"
msgstr "ní thosaíonn sé san áit a gcríochnaíonn an bloc roimhe"

msgid "ends before the next block starts"
msgstr "críochnaíonn sé sula dtosaíonn an chéad bhloc eile"

msgid "  auphonic.com folded them. The mix keeps the two channels; what is gone is the\n  difference between the two microphones of that track."
msgstr "  Chomhcheangail auphonic.com iad. Coinníonn an meascán an dá chainéal; is é an rud atá imithe ná an\n  difríocht idir dhá mhicreafón an riain sin."

msgid "  Two channels, because one track is stereo"
msgstr "  Dhá chainéal, toisc go bhfuil rian amháin i steiréó"

msgid "  Gap of %s at %s -- filled with silence"
msgstr "  Bearna %s ag %s -- líonta le ciúnas"

msgid "  Overlap of %s at %s -- both sound there"
msgstr "  Forluí %s ag %s -- cloistear an dá cheann ansin"

msgid "  They overlap -- several microphones at once, not blocks in a row."
msgstr "  Forluíonn siad -- roinnt micreafón san am céanna, ní bloic i ndiaidh a chéile."

msgid "  Each one also goes into the video as a track of its own: %s"
msgstr "  Téann gach ceann isteach san fhíseán freisin mar rian ar leith: %s"

msgid "  Only the mix goes into the video (--no-single-tracks)."
msgstr "  Ní théann ach an meascán isteach san fhíseán (--no-single-tracks)."

msgid "  It already exists, with the same cameras in the same order -- it stays\n  untouched. Whoever wants a new one deletes it in Resolve."
msgstr "  Tá sé ann cheana, leis na ceamaraí céanna san ord céanna -- fágtar\n  gan athrú é. Más ceann nua atá uait, scrios in Resolve é."

msgid "  Key frames of %s cannot be read (%s) -- the copy starts at the beginning of the file."
msgstr "  Ní féidir eochairfhrámaí %s a léamh (%s) -- tosaíonn an chóip ag tús an chomhaid."

msgid "  Level curve not possible (%s) -- without limiter"
msgstr "  Ní féidir cuar leibhéil a dhéanamh (%s) -- gan teorannóir"

msgid "  Limiter:           at most %s dB, the same curve on every track%s"
msgstr "  Teorannóir:        %s dB ar a mhéad, an cuar céanna ar gach rian%s"

msgid "  Loudness not measurable: %s"
msgstr "  Ní féidir treise fuaime a thomhas: %s"

