msgstr "  Níor seachadadh: níorbh fhéidir leis an rith %s a shuíomh, mar sin ní ceamara den eipeasóid seo é."

msgid "  No measured offset for %s -- placed at the start of the axis."
msgstr "  Gan fritháireamh tomhaiste -- %s curtha ag tús na haise."

msgid "  Nothing was found in the sound for %s -- placed by the timecode alone."
msgstr "  Níor aimsíodh aon rud san fhuaim -- %s curtha de réir an chóid ama amháin."

msgid "  %s: the measurement puts it at %s s, the timecode at %s s -- the measurement is used."
msgstr "  %s: cuireann an tomhas ag %s s é, an cód ama ag %s s -- úsáidtear an tomhas."

msgid "  The Timeline start %s was refused: %s"
msgstr "  Diúltaíodh do thús Timeline %s: %s"

msgid "  The Timeline starts at %s, not at %s -- every shot sits that much further in."
msgstr "  Tosaíonn an Timeline ag %s, ní ag %s -- tá gach seat an méid sin níos faide isteach."

