msgstr "  Ní raibh a leithéid de Timeline ann fós -- níl ann ach é a thógáil."

msgid "  Note: this computes with the files uploaded at the time. They carry\n  the time window and the alignment of that day. Where the In point, the Out point\n  or the measured position differ now, the return check measures the\n  difference and moves the tracks into place."
msgstr "  Nóta: ríomhann sé seo leis na comhaid a uaslódáladh ag an am. Tá\n  raon ama agus ailíniú an lae sin iontu. Nuair atá an pointe isteach, an pointe amach\n  nó an suíomh tomhaiste difriúil anois, tomhaiseann an tseiceáil fillte an\n  difríocht agus bogann sí na rianta ina n-áit."

msgid "  Note: this ffmpeg has no soxr -- clock drift can only be taken out in\n  steps of 21 ppm."
msgstr "  Nóta: níl soxr ag an ffmpeg seo -- ní féidir sruth cloig a bhaint amach ach i\n  gcéimeanna de 21 ppm."

msgid "  Of no consequence for the sound."
msgstr "  Gan iarmhairt ar an bhfuaim."

msgid "  Offset:          %s   (from the camera comparison)"
msgstr "  Fritháireamh:    %s   (ó chomparáid na gceamaraí)"

