msgstr "Scríofa:\n\n  %s"

msgid "Nothing was written -- there is no material yet."
msgstr "Níor scríobhadh aon rud -- níl ábhar ar bith ann fós."

msgid "\nWHO ASKS -- a proposal, and nothing is set from it"
msgstr "\nCÉ A CHUIREANN CEISTEANNA -- moladh, agus ní shocraítear aon rud as"

msgid "  %-20s %s speaking, %s of %s sentences a question"
msgstr "  %-20s %s ag caint, abairtí: %s as %s ina gceisteanna"

msgid "  The order carries, the distance between them does not: measured over four episodes it never turned round, while the distance between first and last changed fourfold. It takes one voice per track; where two of them carry the same speech nothing is said at all."
msgstr "  Seasann an t-ord, ní sheasann an fad eatarthu: arna thomhas thar cheithre eipeasóid níor iompaigh sé riamh, cé gur athraigh an fad idir an chéad duine agus an duine deireanach faoi cheathair. Teastaíonn guth amháin in aghaidh an riain; nuair a iompraíonn dhá rian an chaint chéanna ní deirtear aon rud ar chor ar bith."

msgid "  Who asks -- not said here: two of the tracks carry the same speech, so the questions would go to whichever recorder was turned up loudest."
msgstr "  Cé a chuireann ceisteanna -- ní deirtear anseo é: iompraíonn dhá cheann de na rianta an chaint chéanna, mar sin rachadh na ceisteanna chuig cibé taifeadán ba airde a bhí casta suas."

msgid "\nWHICH MICROPHONE -- a proposal, and nothing is set from it"
msgstr "\nCÉN MICREAFÓN -- moladh, agus ní shocraítear aon rud as"

msgid "  %-20s sounds like %-20s %s %% of it inside that track, %s points ahead of the next"
msgstr "  %-20s cosúil leis an rian %-20s %s %% de laistigh den rian sin, pointí chun tosaigh ar an gcéad cheann eile: %s"

msgid "  It holds under one assumption: one microphone per person, and each of them carrying only that person. Where the tracks overlap too much to be told apart, or two voices point at the same microphone, nothing is said at all rather than something uncertain."
msgstr "  Seasann sé ar thoimhde amháin: micreafón amháin in aghaidh an duine, agus gan ar gach ceann acu ach an duine sin. Nuair a fhorluíonn na rianta an iomarca le go n-aithneofaí óna chéile iad, nó nuair a dhíríonn dhá ghuth ar aon mhicreafón amháin, ní deirtear aon rud seachas rud éigin neamhchinnte."

msgid "\nWHAT THE VOICES COULD BE CALLED -- a proposal"
msgstr "\nCÉN T-AINM A D'FHÉADFAÍ A THABHAIRT AR NA GUTHANNA -- moladh"

msgid "  %-20s could be called %s"
msgstr "  %-20s -- ainm féideartha: %s"

msgid "  %s hardly speaks inside the time window -- proposed: do not use."
msgstr "  %s: is ar éigean a labhraítear laistigh den raon ama -- molta: ná húsáid."

msgid "Guest"
msgstr "Aoi"

msgid "Host"
msgstr "Láithreoir"

msgid "Host %d"
msgstr "Láithreoir %d"

msgid "  Only for voices still carrying the name the program gave them; one somebody typed is never touched. The roles are read off who asks and who answers, which holds for a conversation with one guest and is a proposal, not a setting."
msgstr "  Do ghuthanna a bhfuil an t-ainm a thug an ríomhchlár dóibh fós orthu amháin; ní athraítear riamh ainm a chlóscríobh duine. Léitear na róil as cé a chuireann ceisteanna agus cé a fhreagraíonn, rud a sheasann do chomhrá le haoi amháin agus is moladh é, ní socrú."

msgid "Skip this version"
msgstr "Scipeáil an leagan seo"

msgid "Only this one. The next release asks again, and Help > Look for a newer version now asks at any time."
msgstr "An ceann seo amháin. Fiafróidh an chéad eisiúint eile arís, agus fiafraíonn Cabhair > Lorg leagan níos nuaí anois am ar bith."

msgid "  %s is there already -- not fetched twice"
msgstr "  Tá %s ann cheana -- ní fhaightear faoi dhó é"

