msgid "%s is set, and nothing is adjusted here: the tracks leave as they were recorded, and the loudness is set where they are mixed."
msgstr "Tá %s socraithe, agus ní choigeartaítear aon rud anseo: fágann na rianta mar a taifeadadh iad, agus socraítear an treise fuaime san áit a measctar iad."

msgid "%s can be placed again and is back in the run."
msgstr "Is féidir %s a chur in áit arís agus tá sé ar ais sa rith."

msgid "%s could not be installed.\nBy hand:  %s -m pip install %s"
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir %s a shuiteáil.\nDe láimh:  %s -m pip install %s"

msgid "%s has no audio track."
msgstr "Níl rian fuaime ag %s."

msgid "%s in %s"
msgstr "%s ag %s"

msgid "%s in %s's microphone: %s dB quieter than in their own."
msgstr "%s i micreafón %s: %s dB níos ciúine ná i micreafón an chainteora féin."

msgid "%s is in %s -- the file is now in the player."
msgstr "Tá %s sa chomhad %s -- tá an comhad sa seinnteoir anois."

msgid "%s is not on the axis of the episode: it is set in front of the material or after it, not cut into it. In point and Out point belong to what lies between."
msgstr "Níl %s ar ais na heipeasóide: cuirtear roimh an ábhar nó ina dhiaidh é, ní ghearrtar isteach ann é. Baineann an pointe isteach agus an pointe amach leis an méid atá eatarthu."

msgid "%s is in none of the video files. Is there a timecode that fits the material?"
msgstr "Níl %s in aon cheann de na comhaid físe. An bhfuil cód ama ann a oireann don ábhar?"

msgid "%s%s in %s's microphone only %s dB quieter"
msgstr "%s%s i micreafón %s: gan ach %s dB níos ciúine"

msgid "%s: not seekable yet, will follow (%s)"
msgstr "%s: ní féidir léim ann fós, leanfaidh sé (%s)"

msgid "%s: not there"
msgstr "%s: níl sé ann"

msgid "%s: setPosition(%s), attempt %d, then at %s"
msgstr "%s: setPosition(%s), iarracht %d, ansin ag %s"

msgid "%s: should go to %s%s -- %s"
msgstr "%s: ba cheart dul go %s%s -- %s"

msgid ", no audio"
msgstr ", gan fuaim"

msgid "-- only one camera"
msgstr "-- ceamara amháin"

msgid "--- jump to %s programme time%s ---"
msgstr "--- léim go ham an chláir %s%s ---"

msgid "--- point set, programme time runs from %s ---"
msgstr "--- pointe socraithe, ritheann am an chláir ó %s ---"

msgid "... or add files ..."
msgstr "... nó cuir comhaid leis ..."

msgid "/not seekable"
msgstr "/ní féidir léim ann"

msgid "<span style='color:%(t)s'><b>%(n)s shots</b>, median %(med)s s, shortest %(short)s s, longest camera %(long)s s</span>. Speech time: <b>%(own)s %%</b> on their own camera (%(own_t)s), %(wide)s %% on the wide shot (%(wide_t)s), <span style='color:%(warn)s'>at %(off)s %% (%(off_t)s) the speaker's camera is not active</span>"
msgstr "<span style='color:%(t)s'><b>Seatanna: %(n)s</b>, airmheán %(med)s s, an ceann is giorra %(short)s s, an ceamara is faide %(long)s s</span>. Am cainte: <b>%(own)s %%</b> ar a gceamara féin (%(own_t)s), %(wide)s %% ar an tseat leathan (%(wide_t)s), <span style='color:%(warn)s'>ag %(off)s %% (%(off_t)s) níl ceamara an chainteora gníomhach</span>"

msgid "Every pair of channels is judged on its own: one stereo track, or two microphones and therefore two tracks. Silent inputs drop out. The rows under the file say what was measured, and the tick overrules it."
msgstr "Meastar gach péire cainéal ar leith: rian steiréó amháin, nó dhá mhicreafón agus mar sin dhá rian. Fágtar ionchuir chiúine ar lár. Insíonn na rónna faoin gcomhad cad a tomhaiseadh, agus sáraíonn an tic é sin."

msgid "A negative value makes the picture lead the sound."
msgstr "Le luach diúltach tagann an pictiúr roimh an bhfuaim."

msgid "Add files ..."
msgstr "Cuir comhaid leis ..."

msgid "Alignment goes by the measured offset; the timecode is only the cross-check."
msgstr "Déantar an t-ailíniú de réir an fhritháirimh tomhaiste; níl sa chód ama ach an chrosseiceáil."

msgid "All recordings carry the same name -- that makes a single track."
msgstr "Tá an t-ainm céanna ar gach taifeadadh -- déanann sé sin rian amháin."

msgid "All rows carry the same name -- that makes a single track, and Multitrack needs at least two."
msgstr "Tá an t-ainm céanna ar gach ró -- déanann sé sin rian amháin, agus teastaíonn dhá cheann ar a laghad ó Multitrack."

msgid "Assignment: which audio track belongs to which camera"
msgstr "Sannadh: cén rian fuaime a bhaineann le cén ceamara"

msgid "Audio"
msgstr "Fuaim"

msgid "Audio and video (%s);;All files (*)"
msgstr "Fuaim agus físeán (%s);;Gach comhad (*)"

msgid "Audio at programme time"
msgstr "Fuaim ag am an chláir"

msgid "Auphonic created different tracks than requested: %s instead of %s"
msgstr "Chruthaigh Auphonic rianta eile seachas na cinn a iarradh: %s in ionad %s"

msgid "Auphonic reports an error: %s"
msgstr "Tuairiscíonn Auphonic earráid: %s"

msgid "Bleed"
msgstr "Sceitheadh fuaime"

msgid "Blocks"
msgstr "Bloic"

msgid "Both at once does not work: the returning tracks would go to one value, our own mix to the other. Either set --lufs %.0f or change the preset."
msgstr "Ní oibríonn an dá rud le chéile: rachadh na rianta a thagann ar ais go dtí luach amháin, ár meascán féin go dtí an luach eile. Socraigh --lufs %.0f nó athraigh an réamhshocrú."

msgid "Camera"
msgstr "Ceamara"

msgid "Camera audio, %s to go ..."
msgstr "Fuaim an cheamara, %s fágtha ..."

msgid "%s -- preview  (length %s)"
msgstr "%s -- réamhamharc  (fad %s)"

msgid "Why the run cannot start"
msgstr "Cén fáth nach féidir an rith a thosú"

msgid "Cannot start yet: %s"
msgstr "Ní féidir tosú fós: %s"

msgid "Change rejected: %s"
msgstr "Diúltaíodh don athrú: %s"

msgid "Check again"
msgstr "Seiceáil arís"

msgid "Check the connection to Resolve again"
msgstr "Seiceáil an ceangal le Resolve arís"

msgid "Check itself failed: %s"
msgstr "Theip ar an tseiceáil féin: %s"

msgid "Check the key and fetch Presets."
msgstr "Seiceáil an eochair agus faigh na réamhshocruithe."

msgid "Chosen"
msgstr "Roghnaithe"

msgid "Clock %7.2f%s | B1[%s] %s | B2[%s] %s | Audio %s %s"
msgstr "Clog %7.2f%s | B1[%s] %s | B2[%s] %s | Fuaim %s %s"

msgid "Close"
msgstr "Dún"

msgid "Connects to Resolve again."
msgstr "Ceanglaíonn sé le Resolve arís."

msgid "Content: a camera like any other.\nWide shot: a camera nobody sits in front of -- it takes no speaker, and the cut goes to it in a pause and in a long monologue.\nIntro and outro are finished clips -- not aligned, not processed, only placed in the Timeline.\nIgnore video: the file stays out entirely."
msgstr "Príomhábhar: ceamara cosúil le haon cheann eile.\nSeat leathan: ceamara nach bhfuil aon duine ina shuí os a chomhair -- ní ghlacann sé cainteoir, agus téann an gearradh chuige i sos agus i monalóg fhada.\nIs gearrthóga críochnaithe iad an réamhrá agus an clabhsúr -- gan ailíniú, gan phróiseáil, curtha sa Timeline amháin.\nFág an físeán seo as: fanann an comhad amuigh go hiomlán."

msgid "  %s wide shots: the cut uses %s."
msgstr "  Seatanna leathana: %s; úsáideann an gearradh %s."

msgid "  Every camera carries a speaker, so there is no wide shot: the four wide shot settings and the tick for the edges do nothing here."
msgstr "  Tá cainteoir ag gach ceamara, mar sin níl aon seat leathan ann: níl aon éifeacht anseo ag na ceithre shocrú don tseat leathan ná ag an tic do na himill."

msgid "No camera is free of speakers, so there is no wide shot: the four wide shot settings and the tick for the edges do nothing. Give a camera the Kind \"Wide shot\", or leave one without a speaker."
msgstr "Níl aon cheamara saor ó chainteoirí, mar sin níl aon seat leathan ann: níl aon éifeacht ag na ceithre shocrú don tseat leathan ná ag an tic do na himill. Tabhair an Cineál \"Seat leathan\" do cheamara, nó fág ceamara amháin gan chainteoir."

msgid "placed by phase, sharpness %s against a floor of %s, drift unknown"
msgstr "curtha in áit de réir an phas, géire %s i gcoinne urlár %s, sruth anaithnid"

msgid "placed on the bands that move"
msgstr "curtha in áit ar na bandaí minicíochta a bhogann"

msgid "Why the wide shot settings are grey"
msgstr "Cén fáth a bhfuil socruithe an tseata leathain liath"

msgid "because no speaker is assigned to it"
msgstr "mar níl cainteoir ar bith sannta dó"

msgid "marked as the wide shot -- it takes no speakers"
msgstr "marcáilte mar an seat leathan -- ní ghlacann sé cainteoirí"

msgid "no speaker is assigned to it, but the cut uses %s"
msgstr "níl cainteoir ar bith sannta dó, ach úsáideann an gearradh %s"

msgid "the cut uses %s"
msgstr "úsáideann an gearradh %s"

msgid "Curve and colour space are missing from the file"
msgstr "Tá an cuar agus an spás datha ar iarraidh ón gcomhad"

msgid "In point and Out point are available once the time axis is set -- from the timecode or measured."
msgstr "Bíonn an pointe isteach agus an pointe amach ar fáil nuair atá an ais ama socraithe -- ón gcód ama nó tomhaiste."

msgid "In point is %s before the first frame"
msgstr "Tá an pointe isteach %s roimh an gcéad fhráma"

msgid "In point is now %s, but the existing files belong to %s.\n  The audio in the videos is cut to the old window -- press Start\n  above again."
msgstr "Tá an pointe isteach ag %s anois, ach baineann na comhaid atá ann le %s.\n  Tá fuaim na bhfíseán gearrtha don raon ama a bhí ann roimhe -- brúigh Tosaigh\n  thuas arís."

msgid "Out point is %s after the last frame"
msgstr "Tá an pointe amach %s tar éis an fhráma dheireanaigh"

msgid "Out point is now %s; the window would be %s long, the existing\n  files are %s -- press Start above again."
msgstr "Tá an pointe amach ag %s anois; bheadh an raon ama %s ar fad, tá na comhaid\n  atá ann %s -- brúigh Tosaigh thuas arís."

msgid "Delivery usually takes the limited range. Full is not wrong, but some players misread it."
msgstr "De ghnáth úsáidtear an raon teoranta don seachadadh. Níl an raon iomlán mícheart, ach léann roinnt seinnteoirí go mícheart é."

msgid "Determines how auphonic.com processes the audio.\n\n\"%s\" leaves the key in place and still does not go there.\nThe audio is then only merged and normalised, not unmixed --\nand without separate tracks there is no camera cut."
msgstr "Socraíonn sé conas a phróiseálann auphonic.com an fhuaim.\n\nFágann \"%s\" an eochair ina háit agus fós ní théann sé ann.\nNíl ann ansin ach an fhuaim a chumasc agus a normalú, gan í a dhímheascadh --\nagus gan rianta ar leith níl aon ghearradh ceamara ann."

msgid "Distance to mean"
msgstr "Fad ón meán"

msgid "Drag audio and video files here"
msgstr "Tarraing comhaid fuaime agus físe anseo"

msgid "Dry run: only measuring, nothing written, nothing uploaded."
msgstr "Rith trialach: tomhas amháin, ní scríobhtar aon rud, ní uaslódáiltear aon rud."

msgid "During greeting and farewell the picture stays wide."
msgstr "Fanann an pictiúr leathan le linn beannú agus slán a fhágáil."

msgid "The frames stand a little longer; the file is not any shorter for it. Editing software repeats about one frame every %s s, and picture and camera audio stay together."
msgstr "Seasann na frámaí beagán níos faide; ní bhíonn an comhad níos giorra dá bharr. Athdhéanann bogearraí eagarthóireachta fráma amháin thart ar gach %s s, agus fanann an pictiúr agus fuaim an cheamara le chéile."

msgid "The frames stand a little shorter; the file is not any longer for it. Editing software leaves out about one frame every %s s, and picture and camera audio stay together."
msgstr "Seasann na frámaí beagán níos giorra; ní bhíonn an comhad níos faide dá bharr. Fágann bogearraí eagarthóireachta fráma amháin ar lár thart ar gach %s s, agus fanann an pictiúr agus fuaim an cheamara le chéile."

msgid "Eight bits are not enough for HDR: every gradient bands, and YouTube requires ten or twelve."
msgstr "Ní leor ocht ngiotán do HDR: bíonn bandaí i ngach grádán, agus éilíonn YouTube deich gcinn nó dhá cheann déag."

msgid "Envelope"
msgstr "Imchlúdach"

msgid "  %s is placed on %s, which is no camera of this run -- the cut names it all the same."
msgstr "  Tá %s curtha ar an gcomhad %s, nach ceamara den rith seo é -- ainmníonn an gearradh é mar sin féin."

msgid "Envelope failed: %s"
msgstr "Theip ar an imchlúdach: %s"

msgid "Envelopes and camera audio are prepared in the background."
msgstr "Ullmhaítear na himchlúdaigh agus fuaim an cheamara sa chúlra."

msgid "Every row needs a name -- at Auphonic it becomes the track ID."
msgstr "Teastaíonn ainm ó gach ró -- ag Auphonic is é an track ID é."

msgid "External preview -- the app does not know this format"
msgstr "Réamhamharc seachtrach -- ní aithníonn an aip an fhormáid seo"

msgid "Fetching audio"
msgstr "Fuaim á fáil"

msgid "Fetching audio ..."
msgstr "Fuaim á fáil ..."

msgid "File"
msgstr "Comhad"

msgid "Files are missing there -- without a new upload nothing can be computed.\n  With --auphonic-resume upload the script uploads again; this costs credit."
msgstr "Tá comhaid ar iarraidh ansin -- gan uaslódáil nua ní féidir aon rud a ríomh.\n  Le --auphonic-resume upload uaslódálann an script arís; cosnaíonn sé seo creidmheas."

msgid "For HDR the usual choice is HEVC (Main 10), AV1 or VP9 Profile 2. YouTube takes H.264 too, but it needs more bitrate."
msgstr "Do HDR is gnách HEVC (Main 10), AV1 nó VP9 Profile 2 a roghnú. Glacann YouTube le H.264 freisin, ach teastaíonn ráta giotán níos airde uaidh."

msgid "For ten bits HEVC needs the Main 10 profile. In Resolve it sits under Deliver as \"Profile\"."
msgstr "Do dheich ngiotán teastaíonn an phróifíl Main 10 ó HEVC. In Resolve tá sí faoi Deliver mar \"Profile\"."

msgid "%s fps, not the %s in the file -- %s fewer frames in the same length."
msgstr "%s fps, ní an %s atá sa chomhad -- níos lú frámaí san fhad céanna: %s."

msgid "%s fps, not the %s in the file -- %s more frames in the same length."
msgstr "%s fps, ní an %s atá sa chomhad -- níos mó frámaí san fhad céanna: %s."

msgid "Frame spacing varies by %s %% -- the frame timing is uneven."
msgstr "Athraíonn an spás idir frámaí %s %% -- tá uainiú na bhfrámaí míchothrom."

msgid "Free space there: %s"
msgstr "Spás saor ansin: %s"

msgid "Gap of %s between block %d and %d -- the camera stopped."
msgstr "Bearna %s idir bloc %d agus %d -- stop an ceamara."

msgid "Drag to move the position."
msgstr "Tarraing chun an suíomh a bhogadh."

msgid "HDR needs 16 here (PQ, that is HDR10) or 18 (HLG). In Resolve: Gamma tag = ST.2084 or HLG. 14 is not an HDR curve but SDR in the BT.2020 space."
msgstr "Le haghaidh HDR, ní mór 16 a bheith anseo (PQ, is é sin HDR10) nó 18 (HLG). In Resolve: Gamma tag = ST.2084 nó HLG. Ní cuar HDR é 14 ach SDR sa spás BT.2020."

msgid "HDR needs 9 here (BT.2020). In Resolve: Color space tag = Rec.2020."
msgstr "Le haghaidh HDR, ní mór 9 a bheith anseo (BT.2020). In Resolve: Color space tag = Rec.2020."

msgid "HDR needs 9 here (BT.2020, non-constant luminance)."
msgstr "Le haghaidh HDR, ní mór 9 a bheith anseo (BT.2020, lonras neamhsheasmhach)."

msgid "HLG is display-referred -- it has no entry for the mastering display."
msgstr "Tagraíonn HLG don scáileán (display-referred) -- níl aon iontráil ann don scáileán máistrithe."

msgid "If empty: next to each video file."
msgstr "Má tá sé folamh: in aice le gach comhad físe."

msgid "It arose during the recording and cannot be changed now. The less the microphones are separated, the more cautiously De-Bleed at auphonic.com can work. Next time: three times as far from the neighbouring microphone as from your own mouth, then the neighbouring voice sits about %s dB lower."
msgstr "Tháinig sé seo chun cinn le linn an taifeadta agus ní féidir é a athrú anois. Dá lú an scaradh idir na micreafóin, is ea is cúramaí a chaithfidh De-Bleed ag auphonic.com oibriú. An chéad uair eile: trí huaire níos faide ón micreafón in aice leat ná ó do bhéal féin, agus beidh an guth in aice leat thart ar %s dB níos ísle ansin."

msgid "%s fits nothing in the material, so it cannot be cut into the episode: set to Intro."
msgstr "Ní luíonn an comhad %s le haon rud san ábhar, mar sin ní féidir é a ghearradh isteach san eipeasóid: socraithe mar Réamhrá."

msgid "%s fits nothing in the material either, and the intro is taken: left out."
msgstr "Ní luíonn an comhad %s le haon rud san ábhar ach an oiread, agus tá an Réamhrá tógtha cheana: fágtha amach."

msgid "%s is already set as %s, and an episode has one of those. Answer differently here, or take the mark off that file first."
msgstr "Tá an comhad %s socraithe cheana ar an rogha %s, agus ní bhíonn ach ceann amháin díobh sin in eipeasóid. Freagair ar bhealach eile anseo, nó bain an marc den chomhad sin ar dtús."

msgid "It is in the logs atom of the picture description -- that is how Resolve recognises the input colour space. Different curves mean different input colour spaces."
msgstr "Tá sé in adamh logs de chur síos an phictiúir -- sin mar a aithníonn Resolve an spás datha ionchuir. Ciallaíonn cuair éagsúla spásanna datha ionchuir éagsúla."

msgid "Jumps to the end of the window."
msgstr "Léimeann sé go deireadh an raoin ama."

msgid "Jumps to the start of the window."
msgstr "Léimeann sé go tús an raoin ama."

msgid "Keychain"
msgstr "Keychain"

msgid "Limits the de-bleed: "
msgstr "Cuireann sé teorainn le De-Bleed: "

msgid "Load Presets and pick one, or leave the API Key empty."
msgstr "Luchtaigh na réamhshocruithe agus roghnaigh ceann, nó fág an eochair API folamh."

msgid "Main10 rejected -- the default stays"
msgstr "Diúltaíodh do Main10 -- fanann an luach réamhshocraithe"

msgid "Measure only -- nothing is written or uploaded."
msgstr "Tomhas amháin -- ní scríobhtar ná ní uaslódáiltear aon rud."

msgid "Measuring %s (%s of %s)"
msgstr "Tomhas: %s (%s as %s)"

msgid "Measuring not possible: %s"
msgstr "Ní féidir tomhas: %s"

msgid "Measuring the yardstick"
msgstr "An tslat tomhais á tomhas"

msgid "Measuring time axis ..."
msgstr "Ais ama á tomhas ..."

msgid "Missing audio %s filled with silence%s"
msgstr "Fuaim ar iarraidh %s líonta le ciúnas%s"

msgid "Module DaVinciResolveScript cannot be loaded: %s"
msgstr "Ní féidir an modúl DaVinciResolveScript a luchtú: %s"

msgid "One audio track per person, kept apart all the way to auphonic.com.\nWorks without it as well -- then without de-bleed and leveler.\nIt needs two input tracks: a recording of its own, a channel of a\nmultichannel recorder, or the audio of a video file set to \"use\nthe audio\". The camera cut does not need this tick."
msgstr "Rian fuaime amháin in aghaidh an duine, ar leith an bealach ar fad go dtí auphonic.com.\nOibríonn sé gan é freisin -- ach gan De-Bleed ná Leveler ansin.\nTeastaíonn dhá rian ionchuir: taifeadadh ar leith, cainéal de\nthaifeadán ilchainéil, nó fuaim chomhaid físe atá socraithe ar \"úsáid\nfuaim inmheánach\". Ní theastaíonn an tic seo ón ngearradh ceamara."

msgid "Multitrack (one track per speaker)"
msgstr "Multitrack (rian do gach cainteoir)"

msgid "Multitrack needs at least two input tracks. A track is a recording of its own, a channel of a multichannel recorder, or the audio of a video file set to \"use internal audio\". Several blocks of the same recording count as one, tracks set aside not at all."
msgstr "Teastaíonn dhá rian ionchuir ar a laghad ó Multitrack. Is éard is rian ann taifeadadh ar leith, cainéal de thaifeadán ilchainéil, nó fuaim chomhaid físe atá socraithe ar \"úsáid fuaim inmheánach\". Áirítear roinnt bloc den taifeadadh céanna mar cheann amháin, agus ní áirítear rianta a cuireadh i leataobh ar chor ar bith."

msgid "No API key. Pass --auphonic-api-key KEY, set AUPHONIC_TOKEN or have it remembered once in the interface. The key is in the Auphonic account settings."
msgstr "Níl eochair API ann. Tabhair --auphonic-api-key KEY, socraigh AUPHONIC_TOKEN nó sábháil í uair amháin sa chomhéadan. Tá an eochair i socruithe chuntas Auphonic."

msgid "No audio file carries a timecode. In point and Out point count from the start of the material -- the position of the files to each other is measured."
msgstr "Níl cód ama ar aon chomhad fuaime. Áirítear an pointe isteach agus an pointe amach ó thús an ábhair -- tomhaistear suíomh na gcomhad i gcoibhneas lena chéile."

msgid "No sound in use yet -- add an audio recording, or set a video file's Camera audio to \"use internal audio\" in the file list."
msgstr "Níl aon fhuaim in úsáid fós -- cuir taifeadadh fuaime leis, nó socraigh Fuaim an cheamara de chomhad físe ar \"úsáid fuaim inmheánach\" sa liosta comhad."

msgid "No audio tracks are assigned."
msgstr "Níl aon rian fuaime sannta."

msgid "No camera is assigned, so there is nothing to cut between."
msgstr "Níl aon cheamara sannta, mar sin níl aon rud le gearradh eatarthu."

msgid "No cameras assigned yet -- switch Multitrack on to do that."
msgstr "Níl aon cheamara sannta fós -- cas air Multitrack chun é sin a dhéanamh."

msgid "No connection to Resolve.\n  Is the program running? Is external scripting set to 'Local'\n  under Preferences > System > General?"
msgstr "Níl aon cheangal le Resolve.\n  An bhfuil an ríomhchlár ag rith? An bhfuil scriptiú seachtrach socraithe ar 'Local'\n  faoi Preferences > System > General?"

msgid "No files or project opened yet."
msgstr "Níor osclaíodh aon chomhad ná tionscadal fós."

msgid "No files selected yet."
msgstr "Níor roghnaíodh aon chomhad fós."

msgid "No input possible. Use %s %s to set what should happen."
msgstr "Ní féidir aon ionchur a thabhairt. Úsáid %s %s chun a shocrú cad ba chóir a tharlú."

msgid "No player is built in here -- playback runs in ffplay in its own window."
msgstr "Níl aon seinnteoir ionsuite anseo -- déantar an athsheinm in ffplay, ina fhuinneog féin."

msgid "No preset given, no input possible. Choose one of the above with --auphonic-preset NAME."
msgstr "Níor tugadh aon réamhshocrú, ní féidir aon ionchur a thabhairt. Roghnaigh ceann díobh thuas le --auphonic-preset NAME."

msgid "No presets stored in the account. One can be created in the web interface."
msgstr "Níl aon réamhshocrú stóráilte sa chuntas. Is féidir ceann a chruthú sa chomhéadan gréasáin."

msgid "No speaker is known here -- without who speaks when there is nothing to cut between."
msgstr "Níl aon chainteoir ar eolas anseo -- gan fios cé a labhraíonn cathain, níl aon rud le gearradh eatarthu."

msgid "No voice has a camera yet -- with that every shot would be the same one."
msgstr "Níl ceamara ag aon ghuth fós -- mar sin ba é an seat céanna gach seat."

msgid "No speakers known yet -- nothing measured, nothing separated, and no handover file of an earlier run in %s or its subfolders."
msgstr "Níl aon chainteoirí ar eolas fós -- níor tomhaiseadh aon rud, níor scaradh aon rud, agus níl aon chomhad seachadta ó rith níos luaithe san fhillteán %s ná ina fhofhillteáin."

msgid "Not found again after import: %s"
msgstr "Ní bhfuarthas arís tar éis iompórtála: %s"

msgid "from ffmpeg.org, and the folder into PATH"
msgstr "ó ffmpeg.org, agus an fillteán in PATH"

msgid "over the package manager: apt install ffmpeg, dnf install ffmpeg"
msgstr "tríd an mbainisteoir pacáistí: apt install ffmpeg, dnf install ffmpeg"

msgid "Here: %s. Needed: %s or newer."
msgstr "Anseo: %s. Ag teastáil: %s nó níos nuaí."

msgid "no answer"
msgstr "gan freagra"

msgid "Nothing runs until that is put right."
msgstr "Ní ritheann aon rud go dtí go gcuirtear é sin ina cheart."

msgid "Nothing runs until that is put right. This way: %s"
msgstr "Ní ritheann aon rud go dtí go gcuirtear é sin ina cheart. Mar seo: %s"

msgid "Get it: %s"
msgstr "Faigh é: %s"

msgid "Quit"
msgstr "Scoir"

msgid "That worked."
msgstr "D'éirigh leis."

msgid "Installing ffmpeg"
msgstr "ffmpeg á shuiteáil"

msgid "Start the program again to pick it up."
msgstr "Atosaigh an ríomhchlár chun é a ghlacadh."

msgid "Getting it takes a few minutes, and what it says appears under Output."
msgstr "Tógann sé cúpla nóiméad é a fháil, agus feictear faoi Aschur a n-insíonn sé."

msgid "This takes a few minutes -- a package manager may build from source. What it says appears here."
msgstr "Tógann sé seo cúpla nóiméad -- d'fhéadfadh bainisteoir pacáistí tógáil ón bhfoinse. Feictear anseo a n-insíonn sé."

msgid "Now it is being compiled, and that is the long part: minutes on a fast machine and a good deal longer on an older one. Nothing is stuck -- a dot appears every few seconds for as long as it works."
msgstr "Tá sé á thiomsú anois, agus sin an chuid fhada: nóiméid ar ríomhaire tapa agus i bhfad níos faide ar cheann níos sine. Níl aon rud greamaithe -- feictear ponc gach cúpla soicind fad atá sé ag obair."

msgid "ffmpeg is in place."
msgstr "Tá ffmpeg ina áit."

msgid "The program reads it when it starts. It can start again now, or you can do that yourself later."
msgstr "Léann an ríomhchlár é nuair a thosaíonn sé. Is féidir leis atosú anois, nó is féidir leat é sin a dhéanamh tú féin ar ball."

msgid "Start again now"
msgstr "Atosaigh anois"

msgid "Starting again did not work. Close the window and start the program the way you did before."
msgstr "Níor éirigh leis an atosú. Dún an fhuinneog agus tosaigh an ríomhchlár mar a rinne tú roimhe seo."

msgid "  Taking the ffmpeg that is there out of the way first: %s"
msgstr "  An ffmpeg atá ann á chur as an mbealach ar dtús: %s"

msgid "  A built ffmpeg 9.0.1 with soxr can be fetched: %s"
msgstr "  Is féidir ffmpeg 9.0.1 tógtha le soxr a fháil: %s"

msgid "  Fetch it now? [Y/n] "
msgstr "  É a fháil anois? [Y/n] "

msgid "  Fetching a built ffmpeg. It is a big one, so this takes a few minutes: %s"
msgstr "  ffmpeg tógtha á fháil. Is ceann mór é, mar sin tógfaidh sé seo cúpla nóiméad: %s"

msgid "  %s of %s MB"
msgstr "  %s as %s MB"

msgid "The build could not be fetched: %s"
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir an leagan tógtha a fháil: %s"

msgid "  The build could not be unpacked: %s"
msgstr "  Níorbh fhéidir an leagan tógtha a dhíphacáil: %s"

msgid "  The archive held %s of the two programs."
msgstr "  Bhí %s den dá ríomhchlár sa chartlann."

msgid "  It is here: %s"
msgstr "  Tá sé anseo: %s"

msgid "install Homebrew from brew.sh, then this again"
msgstr "suiteáil Homebrew ó brew.sh, ansin é seo arís"

msgid "This ffmpeg has soxr: the clock drift between cameras comes out in steps of 0.21 ppm."
msgstr "Tá soxr ag an ffmpeg seo: ceartaítear an sruth cloig idir ceamaraí i gcéimeanna 0.21 ppm."

msgid "This ffmpeg has no soxr: the clock drift between cameras comes out in steps of 21 ppm instead of 0.21."
msgstr "Níl soxr ag an ffmpeg seo: ceartaítear an sruth cloig idir ceamaraí i gcéimeanna 21 ppm in áit 0.21."

msgid "Everything works without it. Getting a build that has it takes a few minutes, and what it says appears under Output."
msgstr "Oibríonn gach rud gan é. Tógann sé cúpla nóiméad leagan a bhfuil sé ann a fháil, agus feictear faoi Aschur a n-insíonn sé."

msgid "Carry on"
msgstr "Lean ar aghaidh"

msgid "Not mandatory -- YouTube then applies default values (Sony BVM-X300). To get them: in Resolve switch on HDR10+ under Color Management, run \"Analyze All Shots\" on the Color page and tick \"Embed HDR10 Metadata\" when rendering."
msgstr "Níl sé éigeantach -- cuireann YouTube luachanna réamhshocraithe i bhfeidhm ansin (Sony BVM-X300). Chun iad a fháil: in Resolve cas air HDR10+ faoi Color Management, rith \"Analyze All Shots\" ar an leathanach Color agus cuir tic le \"Embed HDR10 Metadata\" agus tú ag rindreáil."

msgid "Not ready yet:"
msgstr "Níl sé réidh fós:"

msgid "Nothing was audible in the tracks."
msgstr "Ní raibh aon rud le cloisteáil sna rianta."

msgid "One audio recording has no speaker name yet."
msgstr "Níl ainm cainteora ar thaifeadadh fuaime amháin fós."

msgid "One frame back."
msgstr "Fráma amháin siar."

msgid "One second back."
msgstr "Soicind amháin siar."

msgid "Each shot in the colour of its camera. Hover for camera and duration, click to jump."
msgstr "Gach seat i ndath a cheamara. Cuir an cúrsóir air chun an ceamara agus an fad a fheiceáil, cliceáil chun léim ann."

msgid "Only one speaker"
msgstr "Cainteoir amháin"

msgid "Open json project file"
msgstr "Oscail comhad tionscadail json"

msgid "Open result folder"
msgstr "Oscail fillteán na dtorthaí"

msgid "Open the settings, where the key is."
msgstr "Oscail na socruithe, áit a bhfuil an eochair."

msgid "Order does not matter. For a multi-part recording the first block is enough."
msgstr "Is cuma an t-ord. I gcás taifeadta ilchodach, is leor an chéad bhloc."

msgid "Overwrite"
msgstr "Forscríobh"

msgid "Overwrite files"
msgstr "Forscríobh comhaid"

msgid "Pane %d loads %s (%s)"
msgstr "Luchtaíonn painéal %d %s (%s)"

msgid "Pane %d on %s"
msgstr "Painéal %d: %s"

msgid "Play and pause -- the space bar works too."
msgstr "Seinn agus cuir ar sos -- oibríonn an spásbharra freisin."

msgid "Play and pause."
msgstr "Seinn agus cuir ar sos."

msgid "Playback not possible"
msgstr "Ní féidir seinm"

msgid "Playing %s -- the processed track from auphonic.com,\nbrought to broadcast level. The same audio as in the camera cut."
msgstr "Ag seinm %s -- an rian próiseáilte ó auphonic.com,\ntugtha go leibhéal craolta. An fhuaim chéanna agus atá sa ghearradh ceamara."

msgid "Playing %s -- the raw recording.\nIt is much quieter than the processed audio; once the tracks from auphonic.com\nare there, the preview takes those."
msgstr "Ag seinm %s -- an taifeadadh amh.\nTá sé i bhfad níos ciúine ná an fhuaim phróiseáilte; a luaithe a bheidh na rianta ó auphonic.com\nann, úsáideann an réamhamharc iad sin."

msgid "Possible reasons:\n  1. Resolve is not running -- the interface answers only while the program runs.\n  2. Preferences > System > General: external scripting is set to \"None\" instead of \"Local\".\n  3. Free edition: external scripting is reported to be reserved for the Studio edition since version 19.1. I found no official statement -- this check measures it instead of claiming it."
msgstr "Cúiseanna féideartha:\n  1. Níl Resolve ag rith -- ní fhreagraíonn an comhéadan ach fad atá an ríomhchlár ag rith.\n  2. Preferences > System > General: tá scriptiú seachtrach socraithe ar \"None\" in áit \"Local\".\n  3. Eagrán saor in aisce: deirtear go bhfuil scriptiú seachtrach curtha in áirithe don eagrán Studio ó leagan 19.1 i leith. Níor aimsigh mé aon ráiteas oifigiúil -- tomhaiseann an tseiceáil seo é in áit é a mhaíomh."

msgid "Prepare pane %d for %s"
msgstr "Ullmhaigh painéal %d le haghaidh %s"

msgid "Preset not readable: %s"
msgstr "Ní féidir an réamhshocrú a léamh: %s"

msgid "Preview not possible: %s"
msgstr "Ní féidir réamhamharc: %s"

msgid "Preview running ..."
msgstr "Réamhamharc ar siúl ..."

msgid "Prework -- read audio and compute envelopes:\n"
msgstr "Réamhobair -- fuaim a léamh agus imchlúdaigh a ríomh:\n"

msgid "Primaries"
msgstr "Príomhdhathanna"

msgid "Primaries number %d"
msgstr "Príomhdhathanna uimhir %d"

msgid "Processing at auphonic.com (optional)"
msgstr "Próiseáil ag auphonic.com (roghnach)"

msgid "Processing at auphonic.com with \"%s\""
msgstr "Próiseáil ag auphonic.com le \"%s\""

msgid "Production finished, but no ZIP with the individual tracks"
msgstr "Léiriúchán críochnaithe, ach níl aon ZIP leis na rianta aonair"

msgid "Production name"
msgstr "Ainm an léiriúcháin"

msgid "Chosen files"
msgstr "Comhaid roghnaithe"

msgid "Remove the chosen file from the list"
msgstr "Bain an comhad roghnaithe den liosta"

msgid "Project %r could not be created."
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir an tionscadal %r a chruthú."

msgid "Project %r could not be created. Is the name already in another folder?"
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir an tionscadal %r a chruthú. An bhfuil an t-ainm i bhfillteán eile cheana?"

msgid "Project %r could not be opened."
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir an tionscadal %r a oscailt."

msgid "Puts it back next to each video file."
msgstr "Cuireann sé ar ais é in aice le gach comhad físe."

msgid "ROLLBACK FAILED (%s)"
msgstr "THEIP AR AN RÓLLÚ SIAR (%s)"

msgid "Reading audio track from %s"
msgstr "Rian fuaime á léamh ón gcomhad %s"

msgid "Resolutions"
msgstr "Taifigh"

msgid "Resolve running ..."
msgstr "Resolve ag rith ..."

msgid "Resolve scales to the Timeline resolution. Anything smaller is scaled up and gets softer."
msgstr "Scálaíonn Resolve go dtí taifeach an Timeline. Méadaítear aon rud níos lú agus éiríonn sé níos boige."

msgid "Response was not JSON: %s"
msgstr "Níorbh é JSON an freagra: %s"

msgid "Rows marked red show where the problem is; a tick on the tab means everything is there."
msgstr "Taispeánann na rónna atá marcáilte i ndearg cá bhfuil an fhadhb; ciallaíonn tic ar an gcluaisín go bhfuil gach rud ann."

msgid "Save in Keychain"
msgstr "Sábháil i Keychain"

msgid "Save in Registry"
msgstr "Sábháil sa Chlárlann"

msgid "Select audio and video files"
msgstr "Roghnaigh comhaid fuaime agus físe"

msgid "Speakers, as the run measured them"
msgstr "Cainteoirí, mar a thomhais an rith iad"

msgid "Speakers, self-measured from the tracks"
msgstr "Cainteoirí, tomhaiste ag an ríomhchlár féin ó na rianta"

msgid "Started late or stopped early -- this voice is then missing from the mix in places."
msgstr "Tosaíodh go déanach nó stopadh go luath -- bíonn an guth seo in easnamh ón meascán in áiteanna ansin."

msgid "Stopped. Choose another production name -- then a new production\n  is created -- or pick one of the other options."
msgstr "Stoptha. Roghnaigh ainm léiriúcháin eile -- cruthaítear léiriúchán nua ansin\n  -- nó roghnaigh ceann de na roghanna eile."

msgid "Stopped. Nothing was created."
msgstr "Stoptha. Níor cruthaíodh aon rud."

msgid "Stopped. Nothing was uploaded and nothing computed."
msgstr "Stoptha. Níor uaslódáladh aon rud agus níor ríomhadh aon rud."

msgid "Used as it stands -- nothing is invented. Check in Resolve under Clip Attributes, tab Color Space: if it says \"Project\" there, the input colour space was not recognised and has to be set by hand."
msgstr "Úsáidtear é mar atá -- ní chumtar aon rud. Seiceáil in Resolve faoi Clip Attributes, cluaisín Color Space: má deir sé \"Project\" ansin, níor aithníodh an spás datha ionchuir agus caithfear é a shocrú de láimh."

msgid "Takes the position from the picture."
msgstr "Glacann sé an suíomh ón bpictiúr."

msgid "Ten seconds back."
msgstr "Deich soicind siar."

msgid "The Resolve interface is not where I expect it:\n  %s\n  %s"
msgstr "Níl comhéadan Resolve san áit a bhfuil súil agam leis:\n  %s\n  %s"

msgid "The Resolve interface is not where it should be."
msgstr "Níl comhéadan Resolve san áit ar chóir dó a bheith."

msgid "The Timeline gets one fixed rate -- the highest of them, or the next rate Resolve has above it. It converts the others; with 23.976 against 24 that is where its audio analysis tends to stall."
msgstr "Faigheann an Timeline ráta seasta amháin -- an ceann is airde acu, nó an chéad ráta eile atá ag Resolve os a chionn. Tiontaíonn Resolve na cinn eile; le 23.976 in aghaidh 24 is ansin is gnách lena anailís fuaime stopadh."

msgid "The audio recording of every speaker, plus the cameras.\nThe order does not matter -- the program recognises what is what.\nFor a multi-part recording the first block is enough."
msgstr "Taifeadadh fuaime gach cainteora, chomh maith leis na ceamaraí.\nIs cuma an t-ord -- aithníonn an ríomhchlár cad is ea gach rud.\nI gcás taifeadta ilchodach, is leor an chéad bhloc."

msgid "The cut has no picture there. When the Timeline is built the spot stays empty, the audio runs on."
msgstr "Níl aon phictiúr ag an ngearradh ansin. Nuair a thógtar an Timeline fanann an spota folamh, leanann an fhuaim ar aghaidh."

msgid "The existing result is unusable: %s is missing there. With --auphonic-resume rerun it can be recomputed without uploading anything."
msgstr "Níl an toradh atá ann inúsáidte: tá %s in easnamh ann. Le --auphonic-resume rerun is féidir é a athríomh gan aon rud a uaslódáil."

msgid "The cut rules leave no shot standing in these %s. A shorter shortest shot, or less wide shot, gives one again."
msgstr "Ní fhágann rialacha an ghearrtha aon seat sa tréimhse %s seo. Tabharfaidh seat is giorra níos giorra, nó níos lú seat leathan, ceann ar ais."

msgid "The programme is %s long here -- nothing can be laid out in that. In point and Out point are what set it."
msgstr "Tá an clár %s ar fad anseo -- ní féidir aon rud a leagan amach ann. Is iad an pointe isteach agus an pointe amach a shocraíonn é."

msgid "The time window lies outside the material: In point at %s, Out point at %s, and the material runs %s."
msgstr "Tá an raon ama lasmuigh den ábhar: pointe isteach ag %s, pointe amach ag %s, agus maireann an t-ábhar %s."

msgid "The first preset track sets the settings for all our tracks. Otherwise they come back unprocessed. Create a track in the preset in the web interface."
msgstr "Socraíonn an chéad rian den réamhshocrú na socruithe dár rianta go léir. Murach sin tagann siad ar ais gan phróiseáil. Cruthaigh rian sa réamhshocrú sa chomhéadan gréasáin."

msgid "That needs the handover file from a run, and there is none."
msgstr "Teastaíonn comhad seachadta ó rith chuige sin, agus níl ceann ann."

msgid "The key can only be stored on Mac and Windows -- in the keychain or the registry. It does not go into a file."
msgstr "Ní féidir an eochair a stóráil ach ar Mac agus Windows -- i Keychain nó sa Chlárlann. Ní théann sí isteach i gcomhad."

msgid "%s -- being checked"
msgstr "%s -- faoi sheiceáil"

msgid "The key was not saved: %s"
msgstr "Níor sábháladh an eochair: %s"

msgid "The key was not saved"
msgstr "Níor sábháladh an eochair"

msgid "The keychain is locked. Unlock it and try again."
msgstr "Tá Keychain faoi ghlas. Díghlasáil é agus bain triail eile as."

msgid "This run is a test run and the store still carries its real name, so nothing was written. Point KEY_SERVICE, KEY_ACCOUNT or REG_PATH somewhere else first."
msgstr "Rith tástála é an rith seo agus tá a fhíorainm fós ar an stór, mar sin níor scríobhadh aon rud. Dírigh KEY_SERVICE, KEY_ACCOUNT nó REG_PATH áit éigin eile ar dtús."

msgid "The keychain is locked. Unlock it and this button wakes up."
msgstr "Tá Keychain faoi ghlas. Díghlasáil é agus músclóidh an cnaipe seo."

msgid "The keychain did not take the key. Keychain Access can say why."
msgstr "Níor ghlac Keychain leis an eochair. Is féidir le Keychain Access a rá cén fáth."

msgid "The registry did not take the key."
msgstr "Níor ghlac an Chlárlann leis an eochair."

msgid "Open Keychain Access"
msgstr "Oscail Keychain Access"

msgid "Opens the app that unlocks the keychain."
msgstr "Osclaíonn sé an aip a dhíghlasálann Keychain."

msgid "  Keychain Access could not be opened: %s"
msgstr "  Níorbh fhéidir Keychain Access a oscailt: %s"

msgid "The stored key is not accepted: %s"
msgstr "Ní ghlactar leis an eochair stóráilte: %s"

msgid "The key from AUPHONIC_TOKEN is not accepted: %s"
msgstr "Ní ghlactar leis an eochair ó AUPHONIC_TOKEN: %s"

msgid "What auphonic.com replied"
msgstr "An freagra a thug auphonic.com"

msgid "There is no key."
msgstr "Níl aon eochair ann."

msgid "The key has a space or a line break at one end."
msgstr "Tá spás nó briseadh líne ag ceann amháin den eochair."

msgid "The key is broken in the middle by a space or a line break."
msgstr "Tá an eochair briste ina lár ag spás nó briseadh líne."

msgid "The key has a character in it that cannot be typed."
msgstr "Tá carachtar san eochair nach féidir a chlóscríobh."

msgid "The key is then in the %s, never in a file."
msgstr "Beidh an eochair ansin san áit seo: %s, agus ní i gcomhad go deo."

msgid "The production has no name yet."
msgstr "Níl ainm ar an léiriúchán fós."

msgid "The recording assigned to this camera instead of the camera audio."
msgstr "An taifeadadh atá sannta don cheamara seo in áit fhuaim an cheamara."

msgid "The run is still going."
msgstr "Tá an rith fós ar siúl."

msgid "No speakers are known yet -- they are worked out of the tracks as soon as this tab is opened. Where everybody is on one recording, \"several speakers\" in the Speaker name field is the way."
msgstr "Níl aon chainteoirí ar eolas fós -- oibrítear amach ó na rianta iad a luaithe a osclaítear an cluaisín seo. Nuair atá gach duine ar thaifeadadh amháin, is é \"roinnt cainteoirí\" sa réimse Ainm an chainteora an bealach."

msgid "The three numbers are primaries, curve and matrix. Different tags need different input colour spaces in Resolve -- otherwise one camera looks unlike the other."
msgstr "Is iad na trí uimhir na príomhdhathanna, an cuar agus an mhaitrís. Teastaíonn spásanna datha ionchuir éagsúla in Resolve do chlibeanna éagsúla -- murach sin ní bheidh cuma cheamara amháin cosúil leis an gceann eile."

msgid "There are no separate audio recordings. Then the audio of the %s cameras is used -- each becomes a track, and Auphonic removes the bleed."
msgstr "Níl aon taifeadtaí fuaime ar leith ann. Úsáidtear fuaim na gceamaraí ansin (ceamaraí: %s) -- déantar rian de gach ceann, agus baineann Auphonic an sceitheadh fuaime."

msgid "There is no result yet."
msgstr "Níl aon toradh ann fós."

msgid "These files are neither audio nor video and stay out:\n\n  %s"
msgstr "Ní comhaid fuaime ná físe iad na comhaid seo agus fanann siad amuigh:\n\n  %s"

msgid "These files do not exist:\n  "
msgstr "Níl na comhaid seo ann:\n  "

msgid "These files exist already and will be written again:\n\n  %s\n\nIs that intended?"
msgstr "Tá na comhaid seo ann cheana agus scríobhfar arís iad:\n\n  %s\n\nAn é sin atá uait?"

msgid "These files no longer exist:\n  "
msgstr "Níl na comhaid seo ann a thuilleadh:\n  "

msgid "These names occur more than once:\n\n  %s\n\nThe recordings are merged into one track and laid end to end by their timecode. That is right if recording was stopped in between."
msgstr "Tá na hainmneacha seo ann níos mó ná uair amháin:\n\n  %s\n\nCumasctar na taifeadtaí in aon rian amháin agus leagtar i ndiaidh a chéile iad de réir a gcód ama. Is ceart é sin má stopadh an taifeadadh idir an dá linn."

msgid "These tracks got no file: %s"
msgstr "Ní bhfuair na rianta seo aon chomhad: %s"

msgid "This Resolve project already exists"
msgstr "Tá an tionscadal Resolve seo ann cheana"

msgid "This comes from the recording, not afterwards: the microphones sit too close together or too far from the mouth."
msgstr "Ón taifeadadh a thagann sé seo, ní ón iarobair: tá na micreafóin róghar dá chéile nó rófhada ón mbéal."

msgid "This file cannot be played here, and ffplay is missing as a fallback."
msgstr "Ní féidir an comhad seo a sheinm anseo, agus níl ffplay ann mar chúltaca."

msgid "This is not a project file, and there is none in the same folder.\n\nThe search is for %s*.json -- the script writes it into the output folder at start."
msgstr "Ní comhad tionscadail é seo, agus níl ceann ar bith san fhillteán céanna.\n\nTá %s*.json á lorg -- scríobhann an script san fhillteán aschuir é ag an tús."

msgid "This is what happens next"
msgstr "Seo a tharlóidh anois"

msgid "This name is on somebody else already. A name is a person, and the cut puts a person on one camera -- please give this voice its own."
msgstr "Tá an t-ainm seo ar dhuine eile cheana. Is duine é ainm, agus cuireann an gearradh duine ar cheamara amháin -- tabhair a ainm féin don ghuth seo, le do thoil."

msgid "This name occurs more than once. The recordings would become one track -- for Multitrack auphonic.com needs at least two different ones."
msgstr "Tá an t-ainm seo ann níos mó ná uair amháin. Ba rian amháin a bheadh sna taifeadtaí -- le haghaidh Multitrack teastaíonn dhá cheann éagsúla ar a laghad ó auphonic.com."

msgid "This production already exists"
msgstr "Tá an léiriúchán seo ann cheana"

msgid "This production has no result yet."
msgstr "Níl aon toradh ag an léiriúchán seo fós."

msgid "Time limit of %s reached, production still running: %s/engine/status/%s"
msgstr "Teorainn ama %s sroichte, an léiriúchán fós ar siúl: %s/engine/status/%s"

msgid "Timecode %s, the other files are at %s -- this clock was not set."
msgstr "Cód ama %s, tá na comhaid eile ag %s -- níor socraíodh an clog seo."

msgid "Timeline %r could not be created."
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir an Timeline %r a chruthú."

msgid "Title at auphonic.com and start of the new file names."
msgstr "Teideal ag auphonic.com agus tús ainmneacha na gcomhad nua."

msgid "To the In point."
msgstr "Go dtí an pointe isteach."

msgid "To the start."
msgstr "Go dtí an tús."

