msgid "%s carries a timecode from the other side of midnight -- counted as one night, not as a day apart."
msgstr "Cód ama ón taobh eile den mheán oíche: %s -- áirítear é mar oíche amháin, ní mar lá óna chéile."

msgid "A timecode counts from midnight and starts over there. The files are put on one axis before anything is subtracted, otherwise the recording after midnight looks almost a day away from the one before. If these really were recorded on different days, the alignment is wrong and the measured offset is the one to trust."
msgstr "Áiríonn cód ama ón meán oíche agus tosaíonn sé as an nua ansin. Cuirtear na comhaid ar ais amháin sula ndealaítear aon rud, nó bheadh cuma ar an taifeadadh tar éis an mheán oíche go bhfuil sé beagnach lá ón gceann roimhe. Má taifeadadh iad seo i ndáiríre ar laethanta éagsúla, tá an t-ailíniú mícheart agus is é an fritháireamh tomhaiste is iontaofa."

msgid "Channel %d is against the stop: %s times three samples or more in a row, the longest %s (%s ms), the first at %s."
msgstr "Tá cainéal %d ag an teorainn: trí shampla nó níos mó as a chéile, líon uaireanta: %s, an ceann is faide %s (%s ms), an chéad cheann ag %s."

msgid "Counted here, sample by sample, at the rate the file was recorded at: a run of three or more samples on the highest value an integer format can hold. One or two are rounding and are not reported. What is cut off there is gone and no processing brings it back -- but the recording is still the recording, and this holds nothing up. Only integer formats are counted. 32 bit float has no stop at full scale, so there is nothing there to count."
msgstr "Comhairítear anseo é, sampla ar shampla, ag an ráta ar ar taifeadadh an comhad: sraith de thrí shampla nó níos mó ar an luach is airde is féidir le formáid slánuimhreach a choinneáil. Is slánú iad ceann nó dhó agus ní thuairiscítear iad. An méid a ghearrtar ansin, tá sé imithe agus ní thabharfaidh aon phróiseáil ar ais é -- ach is é an taifeadadh an taifeadadh fós, agus ní choinníonn sé seo aon rud siar. Ní chomhairítear ach formáidí slánuimhreacha. Níl aon teorainn ag 32 bit float ag lánscála, mar sin níl aon rud le comhaireamh ansin."

