msgstr "rian steiréó amháin is dócha -- an dá mhicreafón san áit chéanna"

msgid "not recognisable -- only %s of %s places where both channels carry sound, %s needed"
msgstr "ní féidir é a aithint -- níl ach %s as %s de na háiteanna ina bhfuil fuaim ar an dá chainéal, teastaíonn %s"

msgid "not recognisable -- these two agree no better than each does with the channel beside it"
msgstr "ní féidir é a aithint -- ní réitíonn an dá cheann seo le chéile níos fearr ná mar a réitíonn gach ceann acu leis an gcainéal in aice leis"

msgid "not set"
msgstr "gan socrú"

msgid "The language spoken in the recording. It becomes the tag of the\nwritten audio track, and the recognition here is told to expect it.\nPreset from the system language. \"%s\" leaves the track untagged\nand lets the recognition work the language out itself."
msgstr "An teanga a labhraítear sa taifeadadh. Is í clib an riain\nfhuaime a scríobhtar í, agus insítear don aithint anseo súil a bheith aici léi.\nRéamhshocraithe ó theanga an chórais. Fágann \"%s\" an rian gan chlib\nagus ligeann sé don aithint an teanga a oibriú amach í féin."

