msgid "Cutting out track %d of %d"
msgstr "Rian %d as %d á ghearradh"

msgid "cutting failed: %s"
msgstr "theip ar an ngearradh: %s"

msgid "  One camera for everybody: cut into %s shots at the change of speaker, so Resolve can group them."
msgstr "  Ceamara amháin do chách: gearrtha ag gach athrú cainteora, seatanna: %s, ionas gur féidir le Resolve iad a ghrúpáil."

msgid "Shorter shots fall into the following one."
msgstr "Titeann seatanna níos giorra isteach sa chéad cheann eile."

msgid "Speaks at least"
msgstr "Labhraíonn ar a laghad"

msgid "below this the camera does not follow"
msgstr "faoina bhun seo ní leanann an ceamara"

msgid "A short \"yes\" does not move the picture. Without this a block of half a second draws the camera over, and the minimum edit duration then holds it there for seconds."
msgstr "Ní bhogann \"sea\" gearr an pictiúr. Gan é seo tarraingíonn bloc leathshoicind an ceamara anall, agus coinníonn an fad íosta seata ansin é ar feadh soicindí."

msgid "Answer on screen earlier"
msgstr "Freagra ar scáileán níos luaithe"

msgid "before the question ends"
msgstr "sula gcríochnaíonn an cheist"

msgid "Zero is where the asker stops, not where the answer starts: the pause between them belongs to the question. Applies only where \"After a question\" asks for it, and the Edit Change Delay is not added again."
msgstr "Is é an nialas an pointe ina stopann an té a chuireann an cheist, ní an pointe ina dtosaíonn an freagra: is leis an gceist an sos eatarthu. Ní bhaineann sé ach le háiteanna a n-iarrann \"Tar éis ceiste\" é, agus ní chuirtear an Edit Change Delay leis arís."

msgid "Wide shot at least"
msgstr "Seat leathan ar a laghad"

msgid "so long the inserted wide shot stands at least"
msgstr "an fad seo ar a laghad a sheasann an seat leathan a cuireadh isteach"

msgid "It then runs to the end of the sentence. Below five seconds the look reads as a twitch."
msgstr "Ritheann sé ansin go deireadh na habairte. Faoi bhun cúig shoicind is cosúil le preab an sracfhéachaint."

msgid "and at most this long"
msgstr "agus an fad seo ar a mhéad"

msgid "Where the end of the sentence lies beyond it, the last clause break before it ends the shot -- it is not cut off mid-sentence."
msgstr "Nuair atá deireadh na habairte níos faide ná sin, cuireann an briseadh clásail deireanach roimhe deireadh leis an tseat -- ní ghearrtar i lár abairte é."

msgid "Long monologue"
msgstr "Monalóg fhada"

msgid "one person holds the floor past \"Wide shot after\""
msgstr "coinníonn duine amháin an t-urlár thar \"Seat leathan tar éis\""

msgid "\"Alternating\" remembers what the last break of this monologue showed. The listener only gets the picture when someone on that camera was heard in the last 20 seconds; otherwise the wide shot."
msgstr "Coinníonn \"Ar sealaíocht\" cuimhne ar an méid a thaispeáin an briseadh deireanach sa mhonalóg seo. Ní fhaigheann an t-éisteoir an pictiúr ach nuair a chualathas duine ar an gceamara sin sna 20 soicind deireanacha; murach sin, an seat leathan."

msgid "Several speak at once"
msgstr "Roinnt ag caint in éineacht"

msgid "and no camera shows exactly them"
msgstr "agus níl ceamara ann a thaispeánann iad go díreach"

msgid "Cutting into a jumble looks frantic."
msgstr "Breathnaíonn gearradh isteach i manglam fuadrach."

msgid "Nobody speaks"
msgstr "Níl aon duine ag caint"

msgid "no voice is heard at all here"
msgstr "ní chloistear guth ar bith anseo"

msgid "A breath in the middle of a sentence and the end of a thought are both silence, and the program cannot tell them apart. Only the length can: \"Short gap up to\" says how long a silence may be and still count as a breath."
msgstr "Is ciúnas iad araon anáil i lár abairte agus deireadh smaoinimh, agus ní féidir leis an ríomhchlár idirdhealú a dhéanamh eatarthu. Ní féidir ach leis an bhfad é: deir \"Bearna ghearr suas le\" cé chomh fada is féidir le ciúnas a bheith agus fós a bheith ina anáil."

msgid "Short gap up to"
msgstr "Bearna ghearr suas le"

msgid "so long a silence leaves the picture alone"
msgstr "fágann ciúnas chomh fada seo an pictiúr mar atá"

msgid "Only where \"Nobody speaks\" is set to hold a short gap. A gap up to this long changes nothing, a longer one goes to the wide shot. Above two seconds the picture begins to stand on someone silent for over five seconds."
msgstr "Ach amháin nuair atá \"Níl aon duine ag caint\" socraithe chun bearna ghearr a choinneáil. Ní athraíonn bearna chomh fada seo faic, téann bearna níos faide chuig an tseat leathan. Os cionn dhá shoicind tosaíonn an pictiúr ag fanacht ar dhuine ciúin ar feadh níos mó ná cúig shoicind."

msgid "Recognition uncertain"
msgstr "Aithint éiginnte"

msgid "the speaker recognition frays or leaves a heap behind"
msgstr "scaoileann aithint na gcainteoirí as a chéile nó fágann sí carn ina diaidh"

msgid "Guessing puts the wrong person on screen for seconds; the wide shot is right in every case. Somebody is speaking here -- where nobody is, \"Nobody speaks\" decides."
msgstr "Cuireann buille faoi thuairim an duine mícheart ar an scáileán ar feadh soicindí; bíonn an seat leathan ceart i gcónaí. Tá duine éigin ag caint anseo -- áit nach bhfuil aon duine, is é \"Níl aon duine ag caint\" a shocraíonn."

msgid "the picture goes to the answer before it starts"
msgstr "téann an pictiúr chuig an bhfreagra sula dtosaíonn sé"

msgid "Only after a question that is not the main speaker's, when somebody else takes over at once and keeps the floor.\n\"do not go early\" means no early camera change: the picture follows the sound here as it does everywhere else."
msgstr "Ach amháin tar éis ceiste nach leis an bpríomhchainteoir í, nuair a ghlacann duine eile seilbh láithreach agus a choinníonn sé an t-urlár.\nCiallaíonn \"ná téigh roimh ré\" nach n-athraítear an ceamara go luath: leanann an pictiúr an fhuaim anseo mar a dhéanann sé gach áit eile."

msgid "Wide shot"
msgstr "Seat leathan"

msgid "Wide shot %d"
msgstr "Seat leathan %d"

msgid "(wide shot)"
msgstr "(seat leathan)"

msgid "No speaker"
msgstr "Gan chainteoir"

msgid "Listener"
msgstr "Éisteoir"

msgid "Alternating"
msgstr "Ar sealaíocht"

msgid "No camera change"
msgstr "Gan athrú ceamara"

msgid "Hold a short gap"
msgstr "Coinnigh bearna ghearr"

msgid "do not go early"
msgstr "ná téigh roimh ré"

msgid "Answering speaker"
msgstr "An freagróir"

msgid "  %sx away from the speaker because a shot ran longer than %s s"
msgstr "  %sx ar shiúl ón gcainteoir mar gur mhair seat níos faide ná %s s"

msgid "%s is in place."
msgstr "Tá %s suiteáilte."

msgid "This window is still the version it started as. It can start again now and come up as that one, or you can do that yourself later."
msgstr "Tá an fhuinneog seo fós ar an leagan lenar thosaigh sí. Is féidir léi atosú anois agus teacht aníos mar an leagan sin, nó is féidir leat é sin a dhéanamh tú féin níos déanaí."

msgid "This copy runs out of a folder of its own, so pip has nothing here to update. This installs it: %s"
msgstr "Ritheann an chóip seo as fillteán dá cuid féin, mar sin níl aon rud anseo le nuashonrú ag pip. Suiteálann an méid seo í: %s"

msgid "Language of the window"
msgstr "Teanga na fuinneoige"

msgid "A language chosen here is spoken from the next start."
msgstr "Labhraítear teanga a roghnaítear anseo ón gcéad tosú eile."

msgid "Restart the application"
msgstr "Atosaigh an feidhmchlár"

msgid "The work can be written to a project file first."
msgstr "Is féidir an obair a scríobh chuig comhad tionscadail ar dtús."

msgid "Starting the application again brings it at once, and asks first what is to happen to the work. Leaving it alone costs nothing -- it comes at the next start."
msgstr "Má atosaítear an feidhmchlár tagann sí láithreach, agus fiafraítear ar dtús cad ba cheart a dhéanamh leis an obair. Ní chosnaíonn sé faic é a fhágáil mar atá -- tiocfaidh sí ag an gcéad tosú eile."

msgid "The application is about to start again. Shall the work be written to a project file first?"
msgstr "Tá an feidhmchlár ar tí atosú. An scríobhfar an obair chuig comhad tionscadail ar dtús?"

msgid "Written, the new window opens the project again and everything stands where it stood. Not written, it comes up empty and the files have to be added afresh."
msgstr "Má scríobhtar í, osclaíonn an fhuinneog nua an tionscadal arís agus tá gach rud mar a bhí. Mura scríobhtar, tagann an fhuinneog aníos folamh agus caithfear na comhaid a chur leis as an nua."

msgid "Save and restart"
msgstr "Sábháil agus atosaigh"

msgid "Restart without saving"
msgstr "Atosaigh gan sábháil"

msgid "The run is still going. The window can be started again once it is finished."
msgstr "Tá an rith fós ar siúl. Is féidir an fhuinneog a atosú nuair a bheidh sé críochnaithe."

