msgstr "Cad ba cheart a dhéanamh den léiriúchán seo?"

msgid "\"%s\": the cameras on one time axis and a cut by who is speaking.\n\"%s\": the cameras on one time axis, nothing more -- no speakers, no cut."
msgstr "\"%s\": na ceamaraí ar ais ama amháin agus gearradh de réir cé atá ag caint.\n\"%s\": na ceamaraí ar ais ama amháin, faic eile -- gan chainteoirí, gan ghearradh."

msgid "Sync only: no cut. The handover carries the multicam timeline alone; the Resolve project is created from the Output tab."
msgstr "Sioncrónú amháin: gan ghearradh. Níl sa seachadadh ach an Timeline multicam; cruthaítear an tionscadal Resolve ón gcluaisín Aschur."

msgid "Project type: Sync only -- no speakers, no transcript, no cut; the handover carries the multicam timeline alone."
msgstr "Cineál tionscadail: Sioncrónú amháin -- gan chainteoirí, gan tras-scríbhinn, gan ghearradh; níl sa seachadadh ach an Timeline multicam."

msgid "\n  Sync only: no cut by speaker was asked for.\n  Only the Timeline for the multicam clip is built."
msgstr "\n  Sioncrónú amháin: níor iarradh gearradh de réir cainteora.\n  Ní thógtar ach an Timeline don ghearrthóg multicam."

