msgstr "Ainmníonn --new-name %s, nach bhfuil ar cheann de chomhaid cheamara an reatha seo."

msgid "The new name for %s is empty; give a plain file name or leave --new-name out."
msgstr "Tá an t-ainm nua don chomhad %s folamh; tabhair gnáthainm comhaid nó fág --new-name ar lár."

msgid "The new name \"%s\" for %s holds \"%s\", a folder or drive separator; give a plain file name."
msgstr "An t-ainm nua \"%s\" don chomhad %s, tá \"%s\" ann, deighilteoir fillteáin nó tiomántáin; tabhair gnáthainm comhaid."

msgid "The new name \"%s\" for %s begins with a dot, which makes a hidden file or a folder; give a plain file name."
msgstr "Tosaíonn an t-ainm nua \"%s\" don chomhad %s le ponc, rud a dhéanann comhad folaithe nó fillteán de; tabhair gnáthainm comhaid."

msgid "Two cameras would be written as one file, %s: %s and %s."
msgstr "Scríobhfaí dhá cheamara mar aon chomhad amháin, %s: %s agus %s."

msgid "--new-name gives %s two names, \"%s\" and \"%s\"; give each file one."
msgstr "Tugann --new-name dhá ainm don chomhad %s, \"%s\" agus \"%s\"; tabhair ainm amháin do gach comhad."

msgid "The assignment file names the cameras here, so --new-name would be dropped; give the names there or leave --new-name out."
msgstr "Ainmníonn an comhad sannta na ceamaraí anseo, mar sin ligfí --new-name thart; tabhair na hainmneacha ansin nó fág --new-name ar lár."

msgid "With cameras only, each file is named after the tracks taken from its sound, so --new-name would be dropped; leave --new-name out."
msgstr "Le ceamaraí amháin, ainmnítear gach comhad as na rianta a baineadh as a fhuaim, mar sin ligfí --new-name thart; fág --new-name ar lár."

